#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-fft.rst:67
msgid "Initial Analysis Flight"
msgstr "基于飞行中 FFT 的谐波陷波设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-fft.rst:67
msgid "In-Flight FFT Advanced Setup"
msgstr "完成初始 FFT 测试飞行并确认 FFT 正常工作后，可启用基于 FFT 的动态谐波陷波滤波器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-fft.rst:67
msgid "In-Flight FFT: How it Works"
msgstr "将 :ref:`INS_HNTCH_ENABLE<INS_HNTCH_ENABLE>` 设置为 1 以启用谐波陷波滤波器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-fft.rst:7 33ffb61fe148431499cd8bfb1b96fa6c
msgid "In-Flight FFT-Based Harmonic Notch Setup"
msgstr "将 :ref:`INS_HNTCH_MODE<INS_HNTCH_MODE>` 设置为 4 以使用飞行中 FFT 作为中心频率来源。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-fft.rst:9 9579301445074b6cae626c51eb086ea2
msgid ""
"This feature is included in autopilots with 2MB of memory. Check your "
"autopilot's :ref:`binary-features` to determine if your autopilot has this "
"feature (GyroFFT). Also, only 1 FFT-based Notch can be set up."
msgstr ""
"此功能包含在 2MB 内存的飞控中。查看你飞控的 :ref:`binary-features` 以确认是否具备此功能（GyroFFT）。另外，只能设置 "
"1 个基于 FFT 的陷波。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-fft.rst:13 a4ce778abf164aeab7a34f611a9d990d
msgid ""
"ArduPilot comes pre-configured with appropriate defaults for all FFT "
"settings. The only initial setup required is:"
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`INS_HNTCH_FREQ<INS_HNTCH_FREQ>` 设置为比预期最低电机噪声频率低约 20% 的值，作为初始中心频率。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-fft.rst:15 7b1af9fcf9ca46dbb8800033a91d0672
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`FFT_ENABLE <FFT_ENABLE>` = 1 to enable the FFT engine. This then "
"requires that you reboot your autopilot after which FFT support will be "
"enabled and other FFT parameters should be visible in your GCS. With default"
" parameter settings the FFT engine will run a self-check for frequency "
"matching on your hardware. If you do not see any FFT errors then things are "
"working properly."
msgstr "将 :ref:`INS_HNTCH_BW<FFT_ENABLE>` 设置为中心频率的约一半，作为带宽。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-fft.rst:17 50f31bb404104964822d7994d0aff8f3
msgid ""
"With FFT enabled it is best to first perform a test flight to check that "
"your aircraft's particular noise frequencies are being captured and to "
"monitor CPU load. See :ref:`Initial Analysis Flight <common-imu-fft-test-"
"flight>`. Normally, results from this will show clear noise recognition and "
"acceptable cpu loading, and  then you can use the FFT to drive the "
":ref:`harmonic notch<common-imu-notch-filtering>` by setting these "
"parameters:"
msgstr ""
"启用 FFT 后，最好先做一次试飞，确认你飞机特有的噪声频率被捕捉到，并监控 CPU 负载。见 :ref:`初始分析飞行 <common-imu-"
"fft-test-flight>`。通常试飞结果会显示清晰的噪声识别和可接受的 CPU 负载，然后就可以设置以下参数，用 FFT 驱动 "
":ref:`谐波陷波 <common-imu-notch-filtering>`："

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-fft.rst:19 792eaed3c9b242929057477182decabc
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`INS_HNTCH_ENABLE <INS_HNTCH_ENABLE>` and/or :ref:`INS_HNTC2_ENABLE"
" <INS_HNTC2_ENABLE>` = 1 to enable the harmonic notch = 1 to enable the "
"harmonic notch"
msgstr ""
"设置 :ref:`INS_HNTCH_ENABLE <INS_HNTCH_ENABLE>` 和/或 :ref:`INS_HNTC2_ENABLE "
"<INS_HNTC2_ENABLE>` = 1，启用谐波陷波"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-fft.rst:20 d7847d7e3f444cb899cc092e5579dd07
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`INS_HNTCH_MODE <INS_HNTCH_MODE>` and/or :ref:`INS_HNTC2_MODE "
"<INS_HNTC2_MODE>` = 4 to use the FFT detected frequency for controlling the "
"harmonic notch frequency."
msgstr ""
"设置 :ref:`INS_HNTCH_MODE <INS_HNTCH_MODE>` 和/或 :ref:`INS_HNTC2_MODE "
"<INS_HNTC2_MODE>` = 4，用 FFT 检测到的频率控制谐波陷波频率。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-fft.rst:21 6bb87be6577e43ee844dc0456843419d
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`INS_HNTCH_REF <INS_HNTCH_REF>` and/or :ref:`INS_HNTC2_REF "
"<INS_HNTC2_REF>` = 1 to set the harmonic notch reference value, which for "
"FFT analysis generally means no scaling"
msgstr ""
"设置 :ref:`INS_HNTCH_REF <INS_HNTCH_REF>` 和/或 :ref:`INS_HNTC2_REF "
"<INS_HNTC2_REF>` = 1，设定谐波陷波参考值；对 FFT 分析而言这通常意味着不做缩放"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-fft.rst:22 dc5ffe6b99c24751aa7323886f168e32
msgid ""
"The harmonic notch reference frequency parameter, :ref:`INS_HNTCH_FREQ "
"<INS_HNTCH_FREQ>` and/or :ref:`INS_HNTC2_FREQ <INS_HNTC2_FREQ>`, is used to "
"indicate the lowest motor speed for which the ESC telemetry should be used "
"to dynamically set the harmonic notch reference frequency."
msgstr ""
"谐波陷波参考频率参数 :ref:`INS_HNTCH_FREQ <INS_HNTCH_FREQ>` 和/或 :ref:`INS_HNTC2_FREQ "
"<INS_HNTC2_FREQ>` 用于指定使用 ESC 数传动态设定谐波陷波参考频率的最低电机转速。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-fft.rst:24 505ed6bde4934cb9819ea98fa4299fcb
msgid ""
"For most uses with other FFT-related advanced parameters at their default, "
"this is all that is required. The user can do optimization of the filtering "
"setup by analyzing the test flight logs and adjusting notch bandwidth, if "
"desired, by following the :ref:`In-flight FFT Advanced Setup <common-imu-"
"fft-advanced-setup>` instructions."
msgstr ""
"在其他 FFT 相关高级参数保持默认的情况下，大多数用途只需要这些设置。如有需要，用户可按 :ref:`飞行中 FFT 高级设置 <common-"
"imu-fft-advanced-setup>` 的说明分析试飞日志并调整陷波带宽，优化滤波配置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-fft.rst:26 06bca2fd960841719d7f40ef77062993
msgid ""
"Setting up the FFT parameters can be done automatically using the "
"``RCx_OPTION`` auxiliary function \"162\" on a transmitter switch. Set the "
"function to a switch on the transmitter. Hover the vehicle, switch it on "
"(high) for 30 seconds, and switch back low and land. The parameters will "
"have been set up and the switch function removed. NOTE: do not use this "
"feature in firmware version 4.3!"
msgstr ""
"FFT 参数可通过遥控器开关上的 ``RCx_OPTION`` 辅助功能 \"162\" "
"自动设置。把该功能设到遥控器的某个开关上，让载具悬停，拨到开（高位）保持 30 "
"秒，再拨回低位并降落。参数即已设置完成，该开关功能也会被自动移除。注意：不要在 4.3 版固件中使用此功能！"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-fft.rst:28 2d0788e44ef9422397a9fd9f16b549a8
msgid ""
"Using In-Flight FFT can result in poorer performance than a properly set up "
":ref:`Throttle-Based <common-throttle-based-notch>` notch filter since the "
"FFT computations take time and can lag the actual required center frequency."
" In-Flight FFT is useful when the rotor frequencies of the vehicle vary "
"widely as in heavy lift vehicles operating with high and low loads. It can "
"be useful in setting up :ref:`Throttle-Based <common-throttle-based-notch>` "
"notch filters, however, see :ref:`In-flight FFT Advanced Setup <common-imu-"
"fft-advanced-setup>` instructions for more information."
msgstr ""
"使用飞行中 FFT 的效果可能不如正确设置的 :ref:`基于油门的 <common-throttle-based-notch>` 陷波滤波器，因为 "
"FFT 计算需要时间，可能滞后于实际所需的中心频率。当载具的旋翼频率变化范围很大时（如重载/轻载交替作业的重载机型），飞行中 FFT "
"很有用。它也可用于辅助设置 :ref:`基于油门的 <common-throttle-based-notch>` 陷波滤波器，更多信息见 "
":ref:`飞行中 FFT 高级设置 <common-imu-fft-advanced-setup>` 说明。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-fft.rst:31 7e08b925dee94e92842c24b7fc9bb1f6
msgid "FFT Dynamic Harmonic Notch Frequency Tracking"
msgstr "设置 :ref:`INS_HNTCH_FREQ<INS_HNTCH_FREQ>` 为主旋翼在悬停转速下产生的振动基频（以 Hz 为单位）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-fft.rst:33 9362312236dc4b64b9c6902d7fc6b4d7
msgid ""
"FFT mode tracking sets the base frequency to the largest noise peak. "
"Normally, when multiple harmonic notch filters are then enabled, the center "
"frequency of each harmonic is locked to the base frequency of the first "
"filter as an integer multiple, as determined by :ref:`INS_HNTCH_HMNCS "
"<INS_HNTCH_HMNCS>`. The bandwidth of the notch (and any enabled harmonic "
"notches) will maintain a ratio set by the _FREQ/_BW params as the center "
"frequency moves. Setting bit 1 of :ref:`INS_HNTCH_OPTS<INS_HNTCH_OPTS>`, or "
":ref:`INS_HNTC2_OPTS<INS_HNTC2_OPTS>`, will enable each harmonic filter to "
"track the three largest noise peaks, individually."
msgstr ""
"FFT 模式跟踪把基频设为最大的噪声峰。通常，当随后启用多个谐波陷波滤波器时，各次谐波的中心频率会按整数倍锁定到第一个滤波器的基频，由 "
":ref:`INS_HNTCH_HMNCS <INS_HNTCH_HMNCS>` 决定。随着中心频率移动，陷波（及任何已启用的谐波陷波）的带宽将保持 "
"_FREQ/_BW 参数设定的比例。设置 :ref:`INS_HNTCH_OPTS<INS_HNTCH_OPTS>` 或 "
":ref:`INS_HNTC2_OPTS<INS_HNTC2_OPTS>` 的位 1，可让每个谐波滤波器分别独立跟踪三个最大的噪声峰。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-fft.rst:35 189f6d3a74794da7bedbe64c348196c2
msgid ""
"setting bit 1 of the notch options will also change the default value of "
":ref:`INS_HNTCH_HMNCS <INS_HNTCH_HMNCS>` to 1 instead of its normal 3. This "
"is to maintain backwards compatibility with previous firmware versions. You "
"can set :ref:`INS_HNTCH_HMNCS <INS_HNTCH_HMNCS>` back to 3, or whatever is "
"desired, after setting bit 1 of :ref:`INS_HNTCH_HMNCS <INS_HNTCH_HMNCS>`"
msgstr ""
"设置陷波选项的位 1 还会把 :ref:`INS_HNTCH_HMNCS <INS_HNTCH_HMNCS>` 的默认值从通常的 3 改为 "
"1，这是为了与之前的固件版本保持向后兼容。设置位 1 之后，可以把 :ref:`INS_HNTCH_HMNCS <INS_HNTCH_HMNCS>` "
"改回 3 或任何想要的值（此处的位 1 指 :ref:`INS_HNTCH_HMNCS <INS_HNTCH_HMNCS>` 相关陷波选项）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-fft.rst:37 835aa547523a4f40bc8e8df9c9693702
msgid ""
"If you set bit 1 of :ref:`INS_HNTCH_OPTS<INS_HNTCH_OPTS>`, or "
":ref:`INS_HNTC2_OPTS<INS_HNTC2_OPTS>`, the bandwidth should not be half the "
"frequency(default). It should be greatly reduced as more notches (3x more "
"since now tracking three noise peaks) cause more phase lag (i.e. latency), "
"thus the bandwidth needs to be reduced to maintain a reasonable phase lag, "
"else oscillation and a poorer tune will result despite the more accurate "
"filtering compared to throttle-based filtering. The suggested starting point"
" is setting the _FREQ/_BW params to 4/1 ratio instead of the default 2/1. "
"This is because for notch filters, a wider bandwidth causes a greater phase "
"lag per notch. You can also use the `Filter Tool "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/FilterTool/>`__ to check the phase lag"
" for your chosen filtering settings. If your phase lag is higher than it was"
" with the single peak filtering, then you can try reducing the bandwidth "
"even further, balancing the phase lag and the amount of noise in the system."
msgstr ""
"如果设置了 :ref:`INS_HNTCH_OPTS<INS_HNTCH_OPTS>` 或 "
":ref:`INS_HNTC2_OPTS<INS_HNTC2_OPTS>` 的位 "
"1，带宽就不应再取频率的一半（默认值），而应大幅减小：陷波更多（跟踪三个噪声峰，数量是原来的 3 "
"倍）意味着更大的相位滞后（即延迟），因此必须减小带宽以维持合理的相位滞后，否则尽管滤波比基于油门的方式更精确，仍会出现振荡、调参效果反而更差。建议起点是把"
" _FREQ/_BW 参数设为 4:1 而非默认的 2:1，因为对陷波滤波器而言，带宽越宽每个陷波的相位滞后越大。也可以用 `滤波器工具 "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/FilterTool/>`__ "
"检查所选滤波设置的相位滞后。如果相位滞后比单峰滤波时还高，可以尝试进一步减小带宽，在相位滞后与系统噪声量之间取得平衡。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-fft.rst:43 13cdc9d329e645dd846593a2f6db1e26
msgid "FFT Options"
msgstr "如果使用外部调速器控制旋翼转速，可使用静态陷波，但需要在不同转速下测试效果。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-fft.rst:45 21fc89d4b9d94847a82609c5ad2cf8cb
msgid ""
"There are two options that can be selected by setting the appropriate bit in"
" the :ref:`FFT_OPTIONS<FFT_OPTIONS>` parameter that affect FFT operation:"
msgstr "通过设置 :ref:`FFT_OPTIONS<FFT_OPTIONS>` 参数的相应位可以选择两个影响 FFT 运行的选项："

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-fft.rst:48 310b8a5273c94676a68b33e420bc3ddd
msgid "Post Filter Chain FFT Analysis Window"
msgstr ""
"对于使用外部 RPM 传感器的直升机，将 :ref:`INS_HNTCH_MODE<INS_HNTCH_MODE>` 设置为 2（RPM 传感器 1）或"
" 5（RPM 传感器 2），并正确配置 RPM 传感器参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-fft.rst:50 4e0762d3d12640a084492a1b1faac45c
msgid ""
"Normally, the FFT analysis for adjusting the center frequency is done by "
"measuring the noise directly at the output of the unfiltered gyro data. "
"However, if bit 0 of :ref:`FFT_OPTIONS<FFT_OPTIONS>` is set, then the "
"measurement window takes into account the effects of the low pass filter and"
" any configured notch filter(s). This is useful if there is high-frequency "
"noise, which impacts the control response less than lower-frequency noise "
"due to the low pass at the end of the filter chain but may be targeted by "
"the FFT measurement. Setting this bit will only track those lower frequency,"
" and more critical, noise peaks."
msgstr ""
"通常，用于调整中心频率的 FFT 分析直接在未滤波的陀螺仪数据输出处测量噪声。但如果设置了 "
":ref:`FFT_OPTIONS<FFT_OPTIONS>` 的位 "
"0，测量窗口会把低通滤波器和已配置的陷波滤波器的效果考虑在内。这在存在高频噪声时很有用：由于滤波链末端的低通，高频噪声对控制响应的影响小于低频噪声，但仍可能被"
" FFT 测量锁定。设置该位后将只跟踪那些频率更低、更关键的噪声峰。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-fft.rst:53 b20aeb7e80c6459892f2c0fba513de5a
msgid "Motor Noise Check"
msgstr "参考 :ref:`common-rpm-based-notch` 了解基于 RPM 传感器的陷波设置详情。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-fft.rst:55 74319b422b4845cab5759ed9dbe6cdc2
msgid ""
"If bit 1 of :ref:`FFT_OPTIONS<FFT_OPTIONS>` is set and ESC motor rpm "
"telemetry is available, then the measurement window for the FFT is centered "
"about the motor(s) frequency as reported by ESC telemetry. This will "
"generate a GCS warning message if noise from any motor greater than 40db is "
"passing through the filter chain, and identify its level, motor number, and "
"frequency. This bit must be used with bit 0 also set."
msgstr ""
"如果设置了 :ref:`FFT_OPTIONS<FFT_OPTIONS>` 的位 1 且 ESC 电机转速数传可用，则 FFT 的测量窗口会以 ESC "
"数传报告的电机频率为中心。当任一电机超过 40db 的噪声穿过滤波链时，会向地面站发出警告消息，并给出其电平、电机编号和频率。使用该位时必须同时设置位 "
"0。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-fft.rst:58 9092a5b0d239486da0dee65bd7f6cf4c
msgid "Typical Use"
msgstr "完成设置后进行测试飞行，然后查看日志中的 ``HNTCH`` 消息验证陷波频率是否正确跟踪了旋翼转速。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-fft.rst:60 7396f2291cdb4da19cd1388ccb58aa85
msgid ""
"A typical use of the FFT notch filter is in addition to other dynamic "
"harmonic notch filters (Throttle, ESC, or RPM-based). In these "
"configurations, using the post-LPF FFT Window "
":ref:`FFT_OPTIONS<FFT_OPTIONS>` bit will yield the best overall filtering "
"results by positioning the FFT filter to target noise not filtered by the "
"other notch filter and gyro LPF (:ref:`INS_GYRO_FILTER<INS_GYRO_FILTER>`."
msgstr ""
"FFT 陷波滤波器的典型用法是与其他动态谐波陷波滤波器（基于油门、ESC 或 RPM）配合使用。在这类配置中，启用 post-LPF FFT 窗口 "
":ref:`FFT_OPTIONS<FFT_OPTIONS>` 位可获得最佳整体滤波效果——它让 FFT "
"滤波器专门对付其他陷波滤波器和陀螺仪低通滤波器（:ref:`INS_GYRO_FILTER<INS_GYRO_FILTER>`）未滤除的噪声。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-fft.rst:63 2819357e464d4d2f84fb9bf035fa1e1b
msgid "Additional Information"
msgstr ""
"如需对高次谐波进行滤波，调整 :ref:`INS_HNTCH_HMNCS<INS_HNTCH_HMNCS>` 参数。对于典型直升机，通常需要覆盖 1 "
"倍和 2 倍旋翼频率。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-fft.rst:65 bc5bb56c75174f31ab6af43b8c30e653
msgid ""
"For those interested in the details of how this feature works and tradeoffs "
"in some of the advanced parameters, not normally adjusted by users, the "
":ref:`In-Flight FFT: How it Works <common-imu-fft-how-it-works>` document "
"describes the operation and these advanced parameters."
msgstr ""
"如果需要同时对尾桨噪声进行滤波，启用第二组陷波滤波器（:ref:`INS_HNTC2_ENABLE<common-imu-fft-how-it-"
"works>` = 1），并将其模式设置为静态或 RPM 传感器模式（尾桨转速通常为主旋翼的固定倍数）。"
